1. Write a program that can exploit the vulnerability. This program will create a pipe, write data into it, and then read data out of it.
2. Use the program to write data into the pipe. The data will be injected into the reading process.
3. Observe the effects of the injected data on the reading process.

The following is an example of how to use the Dirty Pipe vulnerability to inject data into a reading process.

